  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "type": "opening-grid",
      "chapter": "引言",
      "startFrame": 0,
      "durationInFrames": 488,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "这几年 AI 圈的热词越来越多。",
          "startSec": 0.35,
          "endSec": 2.639,
          "startFrame": 10,
          "endFrame": 79,
          "localStartFrame": 10,
          "localEndFrame": 79
        },
        {
          "text": "大模型、Token、上下文、Prompt、RAG、Agent、MCP。",
          "startSec": 2.879,
          "endSec": 8.496,
          "startFrame": 86,
          "endFrame": 255,
          "localStartFrame": 86,
          "localEndFrame": 255
        },
        {
          "text": "每个字都认识，连在一起却完全看不懂。",
          "startSec": 8.736,
          "endSec": 12.215,
          "startFrame": 262,
          "endFrame": 366,
          "localStartFrame": 262,
          "localEndFrame": 366
        },
        {
          "text": "今天用一支视频，把它们彻底演明白。",
          "startSec": 12.455,
          "endSec": 15.609,
          "startFrame": 374,
          "endFrame": 468,
          "localStartFrame": 374,
          "localEndFrame": 468
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "type": "llm-predict",
      "chapter": "LLM",
      "startFrame": 488,
      "durationInFrames": 535,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "先说大模型，它就像读过互联网几万亿字的超级学霸。",
          "startSec": 16.269,
          "endSec": 20.745,
          "startFrame": 488,
          "endFrame": 622,
          "localStartFrame": 0,
          "localEndFrame": 134
        },
        {
          "text": "但说句大实话，它其实并不是真的懂你。",
          "startSec": 20.985,
          "endSec": 24.164,
          "startFrame": 630,
          "endFrame": 725,
          "localStartFrame": 142,
          "localEndFrame": 237
        },
        {
          "text": "它干的事只有一件：根据上文，预测下一个字。",
          "startSec": 24.404,
          "endSec": 28.16,
          "startFrame": 732,
          "endFrame": 845,
          "localStartFrame": 244,
          "localEndFrame": 357
        },
        {
          "text": "就像中文输入法，你打今天天气真，它自动跳出候选词。",
          "startSec": 28.4,
          "endSec": 33.436,
          "startFrame": 852,
          "endFrame": 1003,
          "localStartFrame": 364,
          "localEndFrame": 515
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "type": "token-split",
      "chapter": "Token",
      "startFrame": 1023,
      "durationInFrames": 531,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "那大模型是按什么单位往下预测的？这就叫 Token。",
          "startSec": 34.096,
          "endSec": 37.958,
          "startFrame": 1023,
          "endFrame": 1139,
          "localStartFrame": 0,
          "localEndFrame": 116
        },
        {
          "text": "你输入帮我制定一份 AI 学习计划，它会被拆成七块字砖。",
          "startSec": 38.198,
          "endSec": 42.99,
          "startFrame": 1146,
          "endFrame": 1290,
          "localStartFrame": 123,
          "localEndFrame": 267
        },
        {
          "text": "中文里大概一到两个字，就是一个 Token。",
          "startSec": 43.23,
          "endSec": 46.298,
          "startFrame": 1297,
          "endFrame": 1389,
          "localStartFrame": 274,
          "localEndFrame": 366
        },
        {
          "text": "Token 就是 AI 世界的手机流量，输入和输出都在按量计费。",
          "startSec": 46.538,
          "endSec": 51.133,
          "startFrame": 1396,
          "endFrame": 1534,
          "localStartFrame": 373,
          "localEndFrame": 511
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "type": "workbench",
      "chapter": "Context",
      "startFrame": 1554,
      "durationInFrames": 588,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "那 AI 一次能记住多少 Token？这叫上下文窗口。",
          "startSec": 51.793,
          "endSec": 55.621,
          "startFrame": 1554,
          "endFrame": 1669,
          "localStartFrame": 0,
          "localEndFrame": 115
        },
        {
          "text": "你可以把它想成一张工作台，桌子越大，能铺开的资料越多。",
          "startSec": 55.861,
          "endSec": 60.99,
          "startFrame": 1676,
          "endFrame": 1830,
          "localStartFrame": 122,
          "localEndFrame": 276
        },
        {
          "text": "可桌子一变小，最早放上去的资料就会被挤掉下去。",
          "startSec": 61.23,
          "endSec": 65.66,
          "startFrame": 1837,
          "endFrame": 1970,
          "localStartFrame": 283,
          "localEndFrame": 416
        },
        {
          "text": "所以聊久了它开始失忆，不是变笨了，是工作台装不下了。",
          "startSec": 65.9,
          "endSec": 70.747,
          "startFrame": 1977,
          "endFrame": 2122,
          "localStartFrame": 423,
          "localEndFrame": 568
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "type": "prompt-terminal",
      "chapter": "Prompt",
      "startFrame": 2142,
      "durationInFrames": 535,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "怎么让 AI 听懂你？靠的就是 Prompt，提示词。",
          "startSec": 71.407,
          "endSec": 75.074,
          "startFrame": 2142,
          "endFrame": 2252,
          "localStartFrame": 0,
          "localEndFrame": 110
        },
        {
          "text": "你只说帮我弄个报告，它只能给你一堆正确的废话。",
          "startSec": 75.314,
          "endSec": 79.282,
          "startFrame": 2259,
          "endFrame": 2378,
          "localStartFrame": 117,
          "localEndFrame": 236
        },
        {
          "text": "但你讲清对象、字数、重点和语气，答案立刻具体十倍。",
          "startSec": 79.522,
          "endSec": 84.361,
          "startFrame": 2386,
          "endFrame": 2531,
          "localStartFrame": 244,
          "localEndFrame": 389
        },
        {
          "text": "Prompt 的本质，就是把任务要求给员工交代清楚。",
          "startSec": 84.601,
          "endSec": 88.558,
          "startFrame": 2538,
          "endFrame": 2657,
          "localStartFrame": 396,
          "localEndFrame": 515
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "type": "rag-flow",
      "chapter": "RAG",
      "startFrame": 2677,
      "durationInFrames": 562,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "可大模型没见过你电脑里的合同和笔记，怎么不让它胡编？",
          "startSec": 89.218,
          "endSec": 93.776,
          "startFrame": 2677,
          "endFrame": 2813,
          "localStartFrame": 0,
          "localEndFrame": 136
        },
        {
          "text": "这就需要 RAG，给 AI 配一个专属资料员。",
          "startSec": 94.016,
          "endSec": 97.187,
          "startFrame": 2820,
          "endFrame": 2916,
          "localStartFrame": 143,
          "localEndFrame": 239
        },
        {
          "text": "你提问时，先从你的文件库里精准检索原文，再交给模型作答。",
          "startSec": 97.427,
          "endSec": 102.998,
          "startFrame": 2923,
          "endFrame": 3090,
          "localStartFrame": 246,
          "localEndFrame": 413
        },
        {
          "text": "普通模型靠记忆闭卷考，RAG 靠查资料开卷考。",
          "startSec": 103.238,
          "endSec": 107.296,
          "startFrame": 3097,
          "endFrame": 3219,
          "localStartFrame": 420,
          "localEndFrame": 542
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "type": "mcp-hub",
      "chapter": "MCP",
      "startFrame": 3239,
      "durationInFrames": 685,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "当 AI 从只会聊天，升级成有手有脚的 Agent 智能体。",
          "startSec": 107.956,
          "endSec": 112.366,
          "startFrame": 3239,
          "endFrame": 3371,
          "localStartFrame": 0,
          "localEndFrame": 132
        },
        {
          "text": "工具一多就麻烦了，每个软件接口各不相同，适配成本极高。",
          "startSec": 112.606,
          "endSec": 117.787,
          "startFrame": 3378,
          "endFrame": 3534,
          "localStartFrame": 139,
          "localEndFrame": 295
        },
        {
          "text": "于是有了 MCP，就像把所有充电口统一成 USB Type-C。",
          "startSec": 118.027,
          "endSec": 124.953,
          "startFrame": 3541,
          "endFrame": 3749,
          "localStartFrame": 302,
          "localEndFrame": 510
        },
        {
          "text": "一根标准协议，让 AI 即插即用连接日历、文件和本地应用。",
          "startSec": 125.193,
          "endSec": 130.145,
          "startFrame": 3756,
          "endFrame": 3904,
          "localStartFrame": 517,
          "localEndFrame": 665
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "type": "spotlight-summary",
      "chapter": "总结",
      "startFrame": 3924,
      "durationInFrames": 634,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "最后十秒，一口气记住八个核心类比。",
          "startSec": 130.805,
          "endSec": 133.93,
          "startFrame": 3924,
          "endFrame": 4018,
          "localStartFrame": 0,
          "localEndFrame": 94
        },
        {
          "text": "大模型是超级学霸，Token 是 AI 流量。",
          "startSec": 134.17,
          "endSec": 137.256,
          "startFrame": 4025,
          "endFrame": 4118,
          "localStartFrame": 101,
          "localEndFrame": 194
        },
        {
          "text": "上下文是工作台大小，Prompt 是任务说明书。",
          "startSec": 137.496,
          "endSec": 141.251,
          "startFrame": 4125,
          "endFrame": 4238,
          "localStartFrame": 201,
          "localEndFrame": 314
        },
        {
          "text": "RAG 是开卷考试，Agent 是有手有脚的智能体。",
          "startSec": 141.491,
          "endSec": 145.143,
          "startFrame": 4245,
          "endFrame": 4354,
          "localStartFrame": 321,
          "localEndFrame": 430
        },
        {
          "text": "MCP 是 AI 世界的 USB 接口，用起来自然就熟了。",
          "startSec": 145.383,
          "endSec": 151.263,
          "startFrame": 4361,
          "endFrame": 4538,
          "localStartFrame": 437,
          "localEndFrame": 614
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "type": "outro-cta",
      "chapter": "总结",
      "startFrame": 4558,
      "durationInFrames": 186,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "如果这支视频帮你理清了思路，记得点个赞收藏起来。",
          "startSec": 151.923,
          "endSec": 156.286,
          "startFrame": 4558,
          "endFrame": 4689,
          "localStartFrame": 0,
          "localEndFrame": 131
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
